cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, or results derived from it, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Modality Gap Properties in Multimodal LLMs for Image Captioning"
abstract: >-
  Code and experiments that decompose the modality gap of a connector-based
  multimodal large language model into four properties (centroid distance,
  total variance, effective rank and subspace alignment) and drive each in turn
  while holding the other three fixed, to attribute image-captioning quality to
  each property.
